{"id": "34447", "title": "太坏会有克星", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 57, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34447.htm", "intro": "三十岁的展之硕是个多金单身汉，有著一副俊俏挺拔的外表，更顶著展宇企副总裁的光环，早已吸引一大票女人的青睐，只可惜，她们都忽略了一件事情－－他非常瞧不起女人，是个标准的大男人沙文主义者，他认为女人除了愚笨、爱哭、任性、容易感情用事外，天生就只能附属在男人身后打理家务，无法成大器、做大事。但是，他的克星却出现了……这个从美国总公司调回、个头只及他肩膀的娇小女人，为什么敢挑战他的权威、跟他针锋相对？他才不相信她能有多大的能耐，他发誓会揪出她的小辫子、折断她的强韧，证明她跟自己所认知的女人没什么两样！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34447", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186464.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186467.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186470.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186471.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186472.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186476.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186485.html", "available": false}, {"title": 